
@Task_Management_API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5168

### Get all tasks
GET {{Task_Management_API_HostAddress}}/api/tasks
Accept: application/json

### Get a task by ID
GET {{Task_Management_API_HostAddress}}/api/tasks/1
Accept: application/json

### Create a task
POST {{Task_Management_API_HostAddress}}/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Learn ASP.NET Core",
  "description": "Practice building REST APIs",
  "isCompleted": false
}

### Delete a task
DELETE {{Task_Management_API_HostAddress}}/api/tasks/1
